{"id":"dudoan-02","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/dudoan-02/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":413.92,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.24,"text":"Section 3. You will hear two sports physiotherapy students, called John and Kath, preparing","words":[["Section",0.0,0.7],["3.",0.7,1.2],["You",2.28,2.54],["will",2.54,2.72],["hear",2.72,2.94],["two",2.94,3.32],["sports",3.32,3.88],["physiotherapy",3.88,4.76],["students,",4.76,5.28],["called",5.7,6.1],["John",6.1,6.56],["and",6.56,6.92],["Kath,",6.92,7.28],["preparing",7.92,8.24]]},{"start":8.24,"end":16.74,"text":"a joint presentation on foot injuries in sports players. First, you have some time to look","words":[["a",8.24,8.5],["joint",8.5,8.76],["presentation",8.76,9.48],["on",9.48,10.4],["foot",10.4,10.92],["injuries",10.92,11.42],["in",11.42,11.9],["sports",11.9,12.32],["players.",12.32,12.84],["First,",13.86,14.5],["you",15.16,15.34],["have",15.34,15.52],["some",15.52,15.72],["time",15.72,16.12],["to",16.12,16.6],["look",16.6,16.74]]},{"start":16.74,"end":69.97,"text":"at questions 21 to 26 on page 4. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["at",16.74,16.88],["questions",16.88,17.18],["21",17.18,18.02],["to",18.02,18.26],["26",18.26,18.8],["on",18.8,19.46],["page",19.46,19.72],["4.",19.72,20.28],["Now",65.79,66.05],["listen",66.05,66.35],["carefully",66.35,66.79],["and",66.79,67.51],["answer",67.51,67.85],["questions",67.85,68.25],["21",68.25,69.13],["to",69.13,69.39],["26.",69.39,69.97]]},{"start":73.43,"end":78.47,"text":"I've had a look at your draft presentation plan and compared it with mine, Cath. And","words":[["I've",73.43,74.01],["had",74.01,74.17],["a",74.17,74.35],["look",74.35,74.47],["at",74.47,74.63],["your",74.63,74.77],["draft",74.77,75.09],["presentation",75.09,75.53],["plan",75.53,76.09],["and",76.09,76.45],["compared",76.45,76.81],["it",76.81,76.99],["with",76.99,77.13],["mine,",77.13,77.39],["Cath.",77.51,77.69],["And",78.17,78.47]]},{"start":78.47,"end":83.17,"text":"we seem to have the same basic structure. We've both included the same three main sections","words":[["we",78.47,78.63],["seem",78.63,78.87],["to",78.87,79.01],["have",79.01,79.11],["the",79.11,79.23],["same",79.23,79.47],["basic",79.47,79.81],["structure.",79.81,80.29],["We've",80.77,81.07],["both",81.07,81.23],["included",81.23,81.65],["the",81.65,81.97],["same",81.97,82.25],["three",82.25,82.51],["main",82.51,82.75],["sections",82.75,83.17]]},{"start":83.17,"end":88.19,"text":"– that's the anatomy of the foot, the injuries, and the treatment. And we've organised","words":[["–",83.17,83.55],["that's",83.55,83.83],["the",83.83,83.95],["anatomy",83.95,84.31],["of",84.31,84.51],["the",84.51,84.59],["foot,",84.59,84.79],["the",85.21,85.35],["injuries,",85.35,85.75],["and",86.09,86.25],["the",86.25,86.37],["treatment.",86.37,86.67],["And",87.23,87.55],["we've",87.55,87.85],["organised",87.85,88.19]]},{"start":88.19,"end":93.41,"text":"our presentations in the same way. But the types of sports we've chosen to illustrate","words":[["our",88.19,88.49],["presentations",88.49,88.83],["in",88.83,89.27],["the",89.27,89.37],["same",89.37,89.65],["way.",89.65,89.93],["But",90.49,90.79],["the",90.79,91.25],["types",91.25,91.65],["of",91.65,91.85],["sports",91.85,92.17],["we've",92.17,92.43],["chosen",92.43,92.87],["to",92.87,93.09],["illustrate",93.09,93.41]]},{"start":93.41,"end":95.25,"text":"the possible injuries aren't the same.","words":[["the",93.41,93.67],["possible",93.67,93.93],["injuries",93.93,94.45],["aren't",94.45,94.79],["the",94.79,94.95],["same.",94.95,95.25]]},{"start":95.57,"end":100.13,"text":"I'll deal with the anatomy bit. I've got notes and a handout on that from Professor","words":[["I'll",95.57,95.95],["deal",95.95,96.11],["with",96.11,96.37],["the",96.37,96.53],["anatomy",96.53,96.95],["bit.",96.95,97.27],["I've",97.75,98.05],["got",98.05,98.15],["notes",98.15,98.41],["and",98.41,98.59],["a",98.59,98.69],["handout",98.69,98.95],["on",98.95,99.29],["that",99.29,99.49],["from",99.49,99.75],["Professor",99.75,100.13]]},{"start":100.13,"end":101.01,"text":"Gilligan's lecture.","words":[["Gilligan's",100.13,100.73],["lecture.",100.73,101.01]]},{"start":101.01,"end":107.65,"text":"Oh, I was hoping to do that. I've downloaded some useful stuff. I do think we should limit","words":[["Oh,",101.01,101.85],["I",102.15,102.39],["was",102.39,102.63],["hoping",102.63,102.99],["to",102.99,103.19],["do",103.19,103.33],["that.",103.33,103.55],["I've",103.89,104.15],["downloaded",104.15,104.47],["some",104.47,104.77],["useful",104.77,105.13],["stuff.",105.13,105.47],["I",106.07,106.25],["do",106.25,106.57],["think",106.57,106.81],["we",106.81,106.99],["should",106.99,107.25],["limit",107.25,107.65]]},{"start":107.65,"end":112.21,"text":"this section, though. We don't want to spend much time on anatomy when the main focus is","words":[["this",107.65,107.97],["section,",107.97,108.33],["though.",108.41,108.55],["We",108.87,109.11],["don't",109.11,109.27],["want",109.27,109.37],["to",109.37,109.49],["spend",109.49,109.61],["much",109.61,109.91],["time",109.91,110.21],["on",110.21,110.37],["anatomy",110.37,110.83],["when",110.83,111.17],["the",111.17,111.29],["main",111.29,111.47],["focus",111.47,111.83],["is",111.83,112.21]]},{"start":112.21,"end":112.83,"text":"on the treatment.","words":[["on",112.21,112.39],["the",112.39,112.49],["treatment.",112.49,112.83]]},{"start":113.11,"end":118.17,"text":"That's true, but in the last section, maybe the two of us could show how some of these","words":[["That's",113.11,113.43],["true,",113.43,113.81],["but",114.07,114.41],["in",114.41,114.67],["the",114.67,114.79],["last",114.79,115.15],["section,",115.15,115.65],["maybe",115.93,116.17],["the",116.17,116.37],["two",116.37,116.57],["of",116.57,116.67],["us",116.67,116.85],["could",116.85,117.03],["show",117.03,117.31],["how",117.31,117.59],["some",117.59,117.87],["of",117.87,118.01],["these",118.01,118.17]]},{"start":118.17,"end":122.69,"text":"therapies actually work. I could be the patient and you could do the treatment.","words":[["therapies",118.17,118.63],["actually",118.63,119.15],["work.",119.15,119.65],["I",120.25,120.47],["could",120.47,120.61],["be",120.61,120.77],["the",120.77,120.89],["patient",120.89,121.23],["and",121.23,121.63],["you",121.63,121.89],["could",121.89,122.05],["do",122.05,122.23],["the",122.23,122.33],["treatment.",122.33,122.69]]},{"start":123.01,"end":127.93,"text":"Hmm, good idea. Because it's hard to find pictures as injuries are mostly internal.","words":[["Hmm,",123.01,123.31],["good",123.63,123.79],["idea.",123.79,124.13],["Because",124.39,124.71],["it's",124.71,125.17],["hard",125.17,125.33],["to",125.33,125.49],["find",125.49,125.69],["pictures",125.69,126.15],["as",126.15,126.55],["injuries",126.55,126.91],["are",126.91,127.13],["mostly",127.13,127.35],["internal.",127.35,127.93]]},{"start":127.93,"end":132.79,"text":"It would be good to hear some first-hand accounts from injured athletes too.","words":[["It",127.93,128.87],["would",128.87,129.35],["be",129.35,129.65],["good",129.65,129.91],["to",129.91,130.11],["hear",130.11,130.27],["some",130.27,130.49],["first",130.49,130.83],["-hand",130.83,131.07],["accounts",131.07,131.45],["from",131.45,131.67],["injured",131.67,131.97],["athletes",131.97,132.51],["too.",132.51,132.79]]},{"start":132.99,"end":134.57,"text":"Yeah, but we don't have time.","words":[["Yeah,",132.99,133.39],["but",133.45,133.63],["we",133.63,133.77],["don't",133.77,133.97],["have",133.97,134.19],["time.",134.19,134.57]]},{"start":134.97,"end":138.61,"text":"No. Should we then discuss different types of heel injury?","words":[["No.",134.97,135.37],["Should",136.05,136.35],["we",136.35,136.51],["then",136.51,136.67],["discuss",136.67,137.01],["different",137.01,137.39],["types",137.39,137.71],["of",137.71,137.95],["heel",137.95,138.23],["injury?",138.23,138.61]]},{"start":139.17,"end":142.89,"text":"It's worth pointing out that these vary enormously in how bad they are.","words":[["It's",139.17,139.45],["worth",139.45,139.71],["pointing",139.71,140.07],["out",140.07,140.37],["that",140.37,140.59],["these",140.59,140.79],["vary",140.79,141.13],["enormously",141.13,141.77],["in",141.77,142.09],["how",142.09,142.27],["bad",142.27,142.49],["they",142.49,142.67],["are.",142.67,142.89]]},{"start":143.29,"end":146.97,"text":"It might be just a pulled muscle, or a bone injury which needs surgery.","words":[["It",143.29,143.45],["might",143.45,143.67],["be",143.67,143.85],["just",143.85,144.01],["a",144.01,144.17],["pulled",144.17,144.27],["muscle,",144.27,144.65],["or",144.87,145.31],["a",145.31,145.53],["bone",145.53,145.71],["injury",145.71,146.03],["which",146.03,146.29],["needs",146.29,146.53],["surgery.",146.53,146.97]]},{"start":147.31,"end":149.39,"text":"Sometimes only an expert can tell the difference.","words":[["Sometimes",147.31,147.79],["only",147.79,148.19],["an",148.19,148.33],["expert",148.33,148.59],["can",148.59,148.93],["tell",148.93,149.01],["the",149.01,149.13],["difference.",149.13,149.39]]},{"start":149.81,"end":153.09,"text":"Excellent. I'll do the slides on that. Leave that one to me.","words":[["Excellent.",149.81,150.21],["I'll",150.69,150.93],["do",150.93,151.05],["the",151.05,151.19],["slides",151.19,151.49],["on",151.49,151.71],["that.",151.71,151.95],["Leave",152.17,152.35],["that",152.35,152.59],["one",152.59,152.73],["to",152.73,152.89],["me.",152.89,153.09]]},{"start":154.17,"end":156.55,"text":"Now, what about causes of heel injuries?","words":[["Now,",154.17,154.39],["what",154.67,154.95],["about",154.95,155.21],["causes",155.21,155.79],["of",155.79,156.03],["heel",156.03,156.21],["injuries?",156.21,156.55]]},{"start":156.55,"end":161.27,"text":"Well, it's easy enough to list them over use, improper footwear...","words":[["Well,",156.55,157.29],["it's",157.49,157.75],["easy",157.75,157.99],["enough",157.99,158.21],["to",158.21,158.41],["list",158.41,158.65],["them",158.65,158.95],["over",158.95,159.43],["use,",159.43,159.87],["improper",160.13,160.47],["footwear...",160.47,161.27]]},{"start":161.27,"end":163.93,"text":"Yes, um, incorrect running style.","words":[["Yes,",161.27,161.49],["um,",161.99,162.31],["incorrect",162.73,163.07],["running",163.07,163.45],["style.",163.45,163.93]]},{"start":164.21,"end":168.17,"text":"They're all relevant, but for simplicity, let's just pick one cause.","words":[["They're",164.21,164.45],["all",164.45,164.57],["relevant,",164.57,165.03],["but",165.39,165.71],["for",165.71,165.97],["simplicity,",165.97,166.57],["let's",166.87,167.07],["just",167.07,167.17],["pick",167.17,167.37],["one",167.37,167.75],["cause.",167.75,168.17]]},{"start":168.67,"end":172.13,"text":"Say, stuff about changing your training habit suddenly.","words":[["Say,",168.67,169.13],["stuff",169.57,169.95],["about",169.95,170.35],["changing",170.35,170.77],["your",170.77,171.05],["training",171.05,171.35],["habit",171.35,171.71],["suddenly.",171.71,172.13]]},{"start":172.75,"end":175.45,"text":"You mean, like, suddenly doing a lot of mountain training?","words":[["You",172.75,172.93],["mean,",172.93,173.15],["like,",173.21,173.41],["suddenly",173.59,174.01],["doing",174.01,174.33],["a",174.33,174.49],["lot",174.49,174.59],["of",174.59,174.71],["mountain",174.71,174.95],["training?",174.95,175.45]]},{"start":175.63,"end":177.05,"text":"Yes, that's a good idea.","words":[["Yes,",175.63,175.83],["that's",176.29,176.55],["a",176.55,176.63],["good",176.63,176.75],["idea.",176.75,177.05]]},{"start":177.73,"end":181.19,"text":"And there was research on that in the latest edition of Physio Journal, wasn't there?","words":[["And",177.73,178.05],["there",178.05,178.23],["was",178.23,178.35],["research",178.35,178.71],["on",178.71,178.97],["that",178.97,179.11],["in",179.11,179.23],["the",179.23,179.33],["latest",179.33,179.59],["edition",179.59,179.93],["of",179.93,180.13],["Physio",180.13,180.45],["Journal,",180.45,180.73],["wasn't",180.83,181.01],["there?",181.01,181.19]]},{"start":181.43,"end":183.01,"text":"Professor Gilligan recommended it to us.","words":[["Professor",181.43,181.67],["Gilligan",181.67,182.05],["recommended",182.05,182.39],["it",182.39,182.67],["to",182.67,182.81],["us.",182.81,183.01]]},{"start":183.01,"end":189.27,"text":"Great! You can leave the bit on stretching techniques to me. I really like all that stuff.","words":[["Great!",183.01,183.43],["You",184.17,184.71],["can",184.71,185.35],["leave",185.35,185.53],["the",185.53,185.69],["bit",185.69,185.85],["on",185.85,186.01],["stretching",186.01,186.33],["techniques",186.33,186.91],["to",186.91,187.05],["me.",187.05,187.27],["I",187.75,188.03],["really",188.03,188.27],["like",188.27,188.59],["all",188.59,188.75],["that",188.75,188.93],["stuff.",188.93,189.27]]},{"start":189.83,"end":191.97,"text":"So, what's going to be your approach there?","words":[["So,",189.83,190.25],["what's",190.49,190.73],["going",190.73,190.87],["to",190.87,190.99],["be",190.99,191.11],["your",191.11,191.27],["approach",191.27,191.65],["there?",191.65,191.97]]},{"start":192.41,"end":196.69,"text":"Well, I'll summarise all the various techniques with visual support,","words":[["Well,",192.41,192.81],["I'll",193.09,193.33],["summarise",193.33,194.19],["all",194.19,194.39],["the",194.39,194.51],["various",194.51,194.85],["techniques",194.85,195.33],["with",195.33,195.71],["visual",195.71,196.17],["support,",196.17,196.69]]},{"start":197.11,"end":201.07,"text":"and then I'll make the point that the stretching should be carefully managed.","words":[["and",197.11,197.35],["then",197.35,197.71],["I'll",197.71,198.07],["make",198.07,198.23],["the",198.23,198.43],["point",198.43,198.67],["that",198.67,198.87],["the",198.87,199.03],["stretching",199.03,199.45],["should",199.45,199.77],["be",199.77,199.97],["carefully",199.97,200.47],["managed.",200.47,201.07]]},{"start":201.57,"end":206.15,"text":"Obviously, you have to be careful not to overstretch and to stretch only when your","words":[["Obviously,",201.57,202.07],["you",202.35,202.45],["have",202.45,202.57],["to",202.57,202.69],["be",202.69,202.81],["careful",202.81,203.09],["not",203.09,203.29],["to",203.29,203.49],["overstretch",203.49,204.33],["and",204.33,204.91],["to",204.91,205.07],["stretch",205.07,205.31],["only",205.31,205.75],["when",205.75,206.01],["your",206.01,206.15]]},{"start":206.15,"end":210.05,"text":"muscles are warmed up. Otherwise, you could do yourself more harm than good.","words":[["muscles",206.15,206.45],["are",206.45,206.67],["warmed",206.67,206.89],["up.",206.89,207.23],["Otherwise,",207.75,208.09],["you",208.33,208.39],["could",208.39,208.51],["do",208.51,208.67],["yourself",208.67,208.99],["more",208.99,209.23],["harm",209.23,209.57],["than",209.57,209.77],["good.",209.77,210.05]]},{"start":210.05,"end":216.01,"text":"It's also important that on a supervised programme, stretching is later on combined with balance","words":[["It's",210.05,211.11],["also",211.11,211.41],["important",211.41,212.01],["that",212.01,212.25],["on",212.25,212.43],["a",212.43,212.55],["supervised",212.55,212.91],["programme,",212.91,213.57],["stretching",213.81,214.09],["is",214.09,214.33],["later",214.33,214.63],["on",214.63,214.91],["combined",214.91,215.21],["with",215.21,215.55],["balance",215.55,216.01]]},{"start":216.01,"end":220.15,"text":"exercises, which stretch and also strengthen the muscles.","words":[["exercises,",216.01,216.97],["which",217.43,217.65],["stretch",217.65,218.03],["and",218.03,218.45],["also",218.45,218.93],["strengthen",218.93,219.61],["the",219.61,219.83],["muscles.",219.83,220.15]]},{"start":220.75,"end":221.55,"text":"OK then.","words":[["OK",220.75,221.17],["then.",221.17,221.55]]},{"start":225.25,"end":231.17,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 27","words":[["Before",225.25,225.51],["you",225.51,225.81],["hear",225.81,226.05],["the",226.05,226.19],["rest",226.19,226.47],["of",226.47,226.61],["the",226.61,226.71],["discussion,",226.71,227.21],["you",227.89,228.19],["have",228.19,228.39],["some",228.39,228.59],["time",228.59,229.01],["to",229.01,229.55],["look",229.55,229.69],["at",229.69,229.85],["questions",229.85,230.15],["27",230.15,231.17]]},{"start":231.17,"end":258.14,"text":"to 30 on page 5. Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.","words":[["to",231.17,231.41],["30",231.41,231.85],["on",231.85,232.53],["page",232.53,232.83],["5.",232.83,233.43],["Now",253.76,254.06],["listen",254.06,254.52],["and",254.52,255.4],["answer",255.4,255.82],["questions",255.82,256.22],["27",256.22,257.26],["to",257.26,257.72],["30.",257.72,258.14]]},{"start":258.14,"end":266.25,"text":"It's always useful to have some information on case studies at the end, in case we're","words":[["It's",258.14,259.24],["always",261.99,262.23],["useful",262.23,262.71],["to",262.71,262.89],["have",262.89,263.07],["some",263.07,263.25],["information",263.25,263.65],["on",263.65,264.11],["case",264.11,264.39],["studies",264.39,264.75],["at",264.75,264.95],["the",264.95,265.03],["end,",265.03,265.35],["in",265.67,265.81],["case",265.81,265.99],["we're",265.99,266.25]]},{"start":266.25,"end":268.99,"text":"short of a material. Did you manage to find anything?","words":[["short",266.25,266.37],["of",266.37,266.53],["a",266.53,266.59],["material.",266.59,266.97],["Did",267.39,267.71],["you",267.71,267.95],["manage",267.95,268.25],["to",268.25,268.45],["find",268.45,268.67],["anything?",268.67,268.99]]},{"start":269.47,"end":275.65,"text":"Yes, a female runner in her 30s talking about her treatment for a swollen heel. Initially","words":[["Yes,",269.47,269.73],["a",270.13,270.35],["female",270.35,270.63],["runner",270.63,271.05],["in",271.05,271.27],["her",271.27,271.45],["30s",271.45,272.15],["talking",272.15,272.41],["about",272.41,272.77],["her",272.77,273.01],["treatment",273.01,273.33],["for",273.33,273.63],["a",273.63,273.79],["swollen",273.79,274.09],["heel.",274.09,274.47],